{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e8ca503-929e-8a17-b3d8-787588eed2b7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T12:21:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, hi. I'm calling about a storm drain? Like the catch basin on my street is totally full of sand, and the whole street is just holding water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Whereabouts is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 321 Admiral Kalbfus Road, in the North End. Right out in front, basically. The drain's at the low spot there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 321 Admiral Kalbfus. And when did the water start sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the weekend. Like Saturday? And it hasn't rained, that's the thing. It's been dry. So it's not a storm, it's just the water from, I don't know, melting and stuff, and it has nowhere to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so it's pooling and not draining. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps, honestly. Cars are going through it really slow and sending water everywhere. I looked down in the grate and it's just packed with sand. Like all that stuff they put down on the roads in the winter? It all washed right into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll clog a basin up fast. So you're asking for it to be cleaned out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:18:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, totally. Can somebody please come clean it out? Because it's been, like, four days now and it's not going anywhere on its own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a work order for the catch basin at 321 Admiral Kalbfus for cleaning. Is it right at the curb, in front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, right at the curb, on our side of the street. You can't miss it, there's a big puddle that kind of stretches across half the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled? What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, you can use 401-555-0197. That's the landline. I'm actually not home right now, I'm at work. I'm in the stockroom at the hardware store, so I might not pick up right away, but there's a machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:19:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. 401-555-0197, I'll note that. Anything else down there, like is the water getting toward anyone's driveway or yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's up at the edge of the driveway, but it hasn't come in. I just, like, don't want to wait until it freezes over, you know? Because the temperature's supposed to drop and then it's just ice across the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good point, and I'll flag that in the order. Crews do the basins in the order they come in, but standing water on a road with freezing coming moves it up a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So like, when do you think? Today? Tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Realistically, I'd say within the next day or two if the weather cooperates. Could be a bit longer if they've got a pile of these, since the sand's clogging them all over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay. I mean, it's been four days already, so, like, a day or two would be great? I just feel like I should've called Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you've called now, and it's in. If it's still sitting there Friday, call us back and we'll see where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:21:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Thank you. Sorry, I have to run, a truck's here to unload."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead. Thanks for calling, Susan. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
